| NEW-003 | OTP non-timing-safe `!==` | Uses [timingSafeHashEqual()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/security/smsOtpToken.ts#17-25) from [smsOtpToken.ts:L17-24](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\security\smsOtpToken.ts#L17-L24) at [verification.ts:L833](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\routes\verification.ts#L833) |
