| NEW-006 | Legal state fail-open | **Fails-closed**: if both compute + snapshot fail → `legalReacceptBlocked: true, reason: "LEGAL_STATUS_UNAVAILABLE"` at [L1727-1733](file:///\\wsl.localhost\Ubuntu\home\bcodex\TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY\server\routes.ts#L1727-L1733) |

