> [!TIP]
> **Overall security posture: Excellent.** All security-critical bugs are resolved. The system now has: mandatory HMAC-based token hashing with fail-fast startup validation, distributed concurrency protection via Valkey, timing-safe hash comparison, fail-closed error handling, unified error responses preventing enumeration, explicit login rate limiting, throttled account recalculation, event-driven legal re-acceptance push, and `SERIALIZABLE` legal ledger sequencing. The only remaining open item is `DESIGN-001` (`routes.ts` monolith extraction).
